<title>PHILIPPINES: Uniwide Holdings up 5.77 pct at 5.50 pesos.</title>
<headline>Uniwide Holdings up 5.77 pct at 5.50 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniwide Holdings Inc rose in late Tuesday trade by 30 centavos, or 5.77 percent, to 5.50 pesos on talk it is seeking a deal with oil refiner Petron Corp to manage and supply convenience stores at service stations, brokers said.</p>
